1
00:00:00,286 --> 00:00:03,496
Will you please rub this on my chest?

2
00:00:04,332 --> 00:00:06,502
(Penny:)Oh, Sheldon. Can't you do that yourself?

3
00:00:06,668 --> 00:00:10,008
(Sheldon:)VapoRub makes my hands smell funny.

4
00:00:10,672 --> 00:00:14,012
- But, Sheldon...
- Please, please, please.

5
00:00:18,221 --> 00:00:19,931
(Penny:)I can't believe I'm doing this.

6
00:00:25,853 --> 00:00:29,443
(Sheldon:)No, no. Counterclockwise,
or my chest hair mats.

7
00:00:31,901 --> 00:00:33,281
(Howard:)Sorry.

8
00:00:33,444 --> 00:00:35,444
[SHELDON SIGHS]

9
00:00:38,241 --> 00:00:40,951
Can you sing "Soft Kitty"?

10
00:00:42,578 --> 00:00:43,618
(Sheldon:)What?

11
00:00:43,788 --> 00:00:46,288
(Sheldon:)My mom used to sing it to me
when I was sick.

12
00:00:46,457 --> 00:00:49,497
- I'm sorry, honey, I don't know it.
- I'll teach you.

13
00:00:51,087 --> 00:00:54,627
[SINGING]
Soft kitty, warm kitty

14
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:59,019
(Sheldon:)Little ball of fur

